Changes:
 sophomorix4 (7.4.4) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [sophomorix-class] Clean up the <class>-teachers/-students/-parents
     subgroups when a schoolclass is killed: sophomorix-class deleted the
     schoolclass group only and left them, and the OU of the class,
     behind.
   * [sophomorix-class] Update the members of all the subgroups, not only
     the teachers one.
   * [sophomorix-class] Use the new lmncli parameters.
